$ adb -s emulator-5554 shell pidof com.izzes.nears
21351
$ ui_freshness_probe -s emulator-5554
{"timestamp": "2026-08-20T21:27:54Z", "pid": 21351, "build_symbols": "isolates/2697748146908883"}
$ adb -s emulator-5554 shell pidof com.izzes.nears
21351
-> NEW pid (20936 -> 21351), NEW build_symbols (isolates/4761369954348891 ->
   isolates/2697748146908883), both records visibly different, cross-check
   still matches pidof on the post-reinstall run.

